{"id":"00665","root":"uni00665_1","name":{"ja":"石川　あむ","en":"Ishikawa Amu"},"title":{"ja":"【壁の石華】","en":"【Stone Flower of the Wall】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【壁の石華】 石川　あむ","en":"【Stone Flower of the Wall】 Ishikawa Amu"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2023-02-28","limited":true,"characterId":243,"profile":{"ja":"希少な忍法、石遁の術“路傍石”を操る対魔忍。ふうま一門に仕える下忍の出身で、学校では主人公の後輩にあたる。“路傍石”は、まるで道端の単なる小石の様に自分を認識させる、つまり完全に存在感を消してしまう忍法で、ひとたび発動すれば彼女が泣こうが叫ぼうが敵に存在を察知される事はない。人見知りで恥ずかしがり屋な性格もあり、忍法を使うまでもなく存在感がないとも言われる。その存在感のなさと、誰にも気付かれない努力と根性を対魔忍ライブラリーに認められ、ふうま宗家御庭番の壱番隊筆頭に抜擢された。そんなあむが夜会に潜入するという任務に臨むことになった。特注のドレスに身を包んだものの、得意の忍法で他の参加者には気づかれないまま会場に佇み、主の活躍をひっそりと見守っている。","en":"She is a Taimanin who wields the rare ninjutsu \"Roadside Stone.\" Born as a low-rank ninja serving the Fuuma clan, she is a junior to the protagonist at the academy. \"Roadside Stone\" makes her blend into the surroundings as if she were just a pebble on the road, completely erasing her presence; once activated, no matter how she cries or shouts, enemies cannot detect her. She's shy and self-conscious, often said to have no presence even without using ninjutsu. Her lack of presence and her unnoticed perseverance earned her recognition from the Taimanin Library, and she was appointed leader of the first squad of the Fuuma family's elite guard. However, when something brings her down, she has a bad habit of trying to become a \"worthless person\" herself—throwing money at gambling, attempting homework on the last day of summer break, and generally indulging in every self-destructive behavior she can think of."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"立花沙羅","forms":[{"id":"uni00665_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[946,1892],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[169,338],"def":[141,282],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","1790001"],"evolve":[["evo00010",5],["evo00011",15],["evo00012",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00665_2","rarity":5,"rarityLab